Third-party notice: Arboretum

Arboretum was created by Ritesh Kanchi, Kaija Frierson, Venkatesh Potluri, Ronald Metoyer, Jennifer Mankoff, Miya Natsuhara, and Matt X. Wang.
Paper: https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/3772318.3791656

This repository includes Arboretum as a git submodule (vendor/arboretum) and imports
parts of it (its intermediate representations, tree layout and braille generation), and
its output designs informed the navigable, table and tactile views for data-structure
diagrams. Arboretum is licensed under the MIT License:

https://github.com/ritesh-kanchi/Arboretum

